  "ruleText": "Env-Or 615.07 Fines Relating to Potential Discharges. For failing to notify the department in violation of Env-Or 604.07, the proposed fine shall be $4,000 per violation.\n\nSource. #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
